WEBVTT

00:08.820 --> 00:15.580
In the deepest darkness lie the sleeping butterflies.

00:16.970 --> 00:23.520
Are they even aware of the blue sky?

00:25.130 --> 00:28.550
The world is fragile, like building blocks.

00:28.680 --> 00:32.530
I want a way to fly away.

00:32.890 --> 00:36.260
I pray for only one thing

00:36.740 --> 00:40.650
for the one that I love.

00:42.430 --> 00:46.380
Now, the dices were thrown.

00:46.440 --> 00:50.390
Paradise will rise in the future.

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I Tooi yumeni musubareru

00:50.410 --> 00:54.580
You and I will unite in this far away dream.

00:54.700 --> 00:58.430
And we will cross this red river.

00:58.490 --> 01:02.230
The flower embraces the cross with uncertainty.

01:02.490 --> 01:06.390
Like that, bloomed a fickle angel.

01:06.390 --> 01:10.460
We will one day find eternal love

01:10.710 --> 01:14.760
and I will give you Paradise.

01:31.170 --> 01:33.000
That Musica is a fake.

01:32.800 --> 01:33.150
Huh?

01:34.140 --> 01:37.560
The whole Musica family was killed
by a accident leaving only me.

01:38.300 --> 01:40.800
So besides me, no other
person can have the name Musica.

01:41.110 --> 01:42.940
Then, that old man was...

01:43.000 --> 01:44.930
He tricked you.

01:46.310 --> 01:51.910
Brutal swordsman Lance

01:56.900 --> 01:57.860
He tricked me?

01:58.490 --> 01:59.820
You're such a country bumpkin!

02:00.410 --> 02:03.120
You'll never get your sword back.

02:05.790 --> 02:08.500
No, that old man is Musica!

02:09.060 --> 02:10.000
What?

02:10.630 --> 02:13.620
Because, he didn't look like a liar to me.

02:14.500 --> 02:16.210
Hey, then what?

02:16.210 --> 02:22.220
If that blacksmith Musica isn't a liar,
are you saying that I'm a liar?!

02:22.220 --> 02:24.900
What's wrong with two people
having the same name?

02:25.100 --> 02:26.810
Why are you so worried?

02:29.230 --> 02:32.900
That's weird. There can't be anyone else
with the name Musica besides me.

02:33.270 --> 02:35.140
Then I'll go and find out for you!

02:36.920 --> 02:40.400
Tell Elie that I went to the
old blacksmith's house.

02:41.030 --> 02:43.100
Tell her, you say?

02:44.120 --> 02:46.020
She's not even here.

02:46.890 --> 02:51.920
Come to think of it, she was saying
something was wrong with her Tonfa guns...

02:53.800 --> 02:55.360
What a troublesome girl...

03:01.640 --> 03:03.180
Excuse me..

03:03.690 --> 03:06.220
These are single barreled guns.

03:06.550 --> 03:09.890
Huh? Single barreled guns?
You have a complaint?

03:11.570 --> 03:12.980
You idiots!

03:13.020 --> 03:16.400
So-so-so-sorry... Lance!

03:17.230 --> 03:18.810
That's enough.

03:28.120 --> 03:30.180
Punishment?!

03:30.180 --> 03:32.420
Please forgive me!

03:34.620 --> 03:37.790
He wanted my time, that useless piece of shit.

03:38.450 --> 03:40.090
Lance, I have a message.

03:40.590 --> 03:41.390
A girl?

03:41.470 --> 03:46.960
Yes. She is definitely the one who was
with the boy they call the successor.

03:47.800 --> 03:49.640
You know, guys?

03:49.640 --> 03:50.610
Yes?

03:50.610 --> 03:54.850
A boy and a girl. Moreover, the boy is a Rave Master.

03:55.020 --> 04:00.300
Which of course means, that
it's Lance's turn, right?

04:02.130 --> 04:03.680
I want to cut...

04:03.880 --> 04:04.490
Huh?

04:04.490 --> 04:10.000
I can't stop this feeling, I
must cut someone now!

04:14.120 --> 04:15.880
Just give up already.

04:15.920 --> 04:18.920
Even if you wait for hours, things
I can't fix are still things I can't fix.

04:18.950 --> 04:21.650
But please. I'll pay double the price for it.

04:22.050 --> 04:24.340
Then just buy a new one!

04:25.090 --> 04:26.700
These are my favorite!

04:27.010 --> 04:29.510
Listen, I'll say it only once.

04:29.580 --> 04:33.370
The weapons that are remodeled are banned
from being remodeled for a half a year.

04:33.370 --> 04:36.020
That's the Demon Card's law in this town.

04:36.390 --> 04:38.520
Do you want to get sued?

04:38.560 --> 04:40.650
Please! I beg of you!

04:43.760 --> 04:46.820
By the way, young lady,
what is that creature called?

04:48.490 --> 04:50.200
They say it's a dog.

04:52.880 --> 04:57.630
How about, if you give me
that one, I'll do you a favor.

04:58.750 --> 04:59.900
Hmm...

05:07.450 --> 05:08.090
There it is.

05:17.520 --> 05:18.580
Save me!

05:19.100 --> 05:20.690
Are you that boy 'Haru'?

05:24.190 --> 05:25.680
Mu-Musica...

05:26.690 --> 05:28.190
Oh, you're not.

05:28.400 --> 05:29.910
Who the hell are you?

05:31.830 --> 05:34.860
Demon Card, the 17th corps
Commanding Officer, General.

05:34.890 --> 05:36.790
Lance, the beast swordsman.

05:36.790 --> 05:38.000
Remember my name well.

05:38.410 --> 05:40.110
Let Elie go!

05:40.650 --> 05:42.070
Out of my way!

05:44.090 --> 05:44.970
What?!

05:53.100 --> 05:54.940
You drank too much, old man!

06:02.000 --> 06:02.350
So?

06:02.800 --> 06:06.190
You came to find out if I'm a liar, right?

06:06.620 --> 06:08.390
You don't look like one to me.

06:12.120 --> 06:13.650
Is that so?

06:18.120 --> 06:21.790
I said I would fix this sword, but that was a lie.

06:22.790 --> 06:25.630
The truth is, I was going
sell it to the Demon Card.

06:26.300 --> 06:28.320
But, you know that now...

06:29.590 --> 06:34.300
You borrowed Shiba's precious sword, right?

06:34.890 --> 06:37.810
I'll give it to you, hurry and go give it back to Shiba!

06:39.020 --> 06:41.100
I didn't borrow. It was given to me.

06:41.600 --> 06:43.660
Don't fool around with me.

06:43.910 --> 06:46.980
A boy like you can't handle Rave.

06:47.610 --> 06:50.030
Shiba gave this to me.

07:06.630 --> 07:07.710
Sis, Sis!

07:09.210 --> 07:10.800
What's the matter, boy?

07:11.170 --> 07:12.690
Where did Shabutaro go?

07:13.010 --> 07:16.200
Shabutaro? That dog's name?

07:16.230 --> 07:19.870
Dog?! No, there is no other creature like it.

07:20.340 --> 07:21.910
But you're just like him.

07:23.730 --> 07:25.570
So, do you know where Shabutaro went?

07:26.230 --> 07:28.060
I haven't seen him.

07:29.120 --> 07:30.640
Well, I wonder if he got lost.

07:31.110 --> 07:32.340
I'm going go look for him.

07:32.440 --> 07:34.740
Come back by dinner time, ok?

07:34.820 --> 07:36.050
I know!

07:36.490 --> 07:38.340
Are you worried about him?

07:38.490 --> 07:42.260
Somehow, I feel he's going
go somewhere far away...

07:42.620 --> 07:47.290
It's alright. I'm not going leave Cattleya alone.

07:47.790 --> 07:48.710
Is that right?

07:48.970 --> 07:53.070
I'll tell you my love story of when I was young.

07:53.420 --> 07:56.430
Yes, that was when I was
the medical company's...

07:56.460 --> 07:59.100
Oh yeah, I haven't finished the laundry yet.

08:01.450 --> 08:03.520
I wanted to tell her...

08:04.390 --> 08:07.610
Shabutaro. Shabutaro.

08:08.430 --> 08:09.610
Ah, Shabutaro!

08:12.690 --> 08:15.170
Where were you? I was worried!

08:21.170 --> 08:21.800
Hey...

08:23.120 --> 08:25.460
You are alive, Plue.

08:25.800 --> 08:26.200
Huh?

08:27.560 --> 08:29.630
Plue? You mean this guy?

08:30.130 --> 08:33.340
That's right. I've been searching for him for fifty years,.

08:33.730 --> 08:35.010
Fifty years?!

08:35.850 --> 08:37.190
How old are you?

08:37.220 --> 08:38.860
Never mind that. Who are you?!

08:39.220 --> 08:40.600
My name is Shiba.

08:41.100 --> 08:42.520
You should've know that already.

08:43.310 --> 08:44.400
I've never heard of you.

08:45.580 --> 08:46.890
Hmm... I see...

08:47.810 --> 08:52.530
Already... Already there are people
who know nothing about me.

08:52.820 --> 08:55.110
That's nasty.

08:57.670 --> 08:58.860
Well, I'm Haru.

08:59.490 --> 09:02.490
And I named him Shabutaro, but...

09:03.120 --> 09:03.900
Haru?!

09:04.290 --> 09:07.380
I think I've heard that name somewhere...

09:11.200 --> 09:11.500
Yeah!

09:11.730 --> 09:13.740
I have forgotten!

09:12.510 --> 09:13.740
What?!

09:14.800 --> 09:18.370
Haru, Plue, no Shabutaro...

09:19.000 --> 09:20.210
Plue is fine with me.

09:20.800 --> 09:21.970
Good.

09:22.880 --> 09:25.680
Can you give Plue back to me?!

09:26.100 --> 09:32.900
I must have him. I need to take care
of past mistakes with his help.

09:36.110 --> 09:38.200
Past mistakes, huh?

09:38.450 --> 09:39.880
What's wrong, old man?

09:40.910 --> 09:42.400
Well, nothing.

09:43.000 --> 09:48.220
That guy does sound like the one I know.

09:49.000 --> 09:51.000
Did he tell you his reason?

09:51.500 --> 09:51.900
Yeah.

10:54.400 --> 10:57.780
Such and such... But...

11:00.030 --> 11:01.900
And that happened fifty years ago?

11:02.610 --> 11:06.010
When Overdrive happened,
the Dark Bring ran away.

11:06.010 --> 11:09.090
And now, fifty years later,
Dark Bring is on the move again.

11:09.620 --> 11:12.740
Only Rave can fight against it.

11:15.050 --> 11:19.050
This is all my fault, because I didn't
finish it off back then.

11:19.600 --> 11:22.870
That's why I alone must defeat the Dark Bring.

11:23.260 --> 11:28.340
In order to do that, I must first collect the
scattered Rave to make it into one.

11:29.420 --> 11:30.980
Make the Rave into one?

11:32.520 --> 11:36.200
Plue is the only one who knows where Rave is.

11:36.520 --> 11:38.060
This Shabutaro does?!

11:38.400 --> 11:42.610
Shabutaro... No, Plue is Rave's handler.

11:43.520 --> 11:44.700
Rave's handler?

11:45.410 --> 11:47.780
And you've been looking
for him for fifty years.

11:47.920 --> 11:48.790
That's right.

11:48.830 --> 11:51.750
By the way, what is Rave anyway?

11:51.910 --> 11:53.840
You... You don't even know?!

11:54.210 --> 11:59.500
That story is from a long time ago,
so I don't quite get it, you know.

12:00.000 --> 12:02.130
Young guys these days...

12:02.510 --> 12:05.220
But about Shabutaro, no, Plue... I'll give him back to you.

12:05.510 --> 12:07.300
Oh, you will? Thank you.

12:07.720 --> 12:10.210
That's ok, because we are friends, right?

12:10.700 --> 12:12.810
Hm?! Friends?!

12:13.600 --> 12:16.190
Yeah! It looks like you don't have any friends here.

12:16.380 --> 12:18.880
I will be your friend!

12:19.490 --> 12:20.820
Wha... What the...

12:25.320 --> 12:27.030
I'm so happy!

12:28.070 --> 12:29.910
Your nose is running!

12:31.090 --> 12:34.230
Nose? That old man is Shiba without mistake!

12:34.320 --> 12:36.690
You figured that out just by his running nose?

12:39.720 --> 12:42.430
Shit, this is unlike me...

12:49.800 --> 12:51.790
Search for him! He must still be near here.

12:52.310 --> 12:56.490
Even if I say, "I didn't do it",
they won't believe me.

13:00.610 --> 13:05.190
Bring the Rave to my castle by 5pm,
that is two hours from now.

13:05.950 --> 13:09.960
If you are even a second late,
I will take this girl's life.

13:13.620 --> 13:15.000
I must hurry for Elie's sake...

13:20.900 --> 13:23.390
Are you telling me to tell Haru first?

13:41.810 --> 13:44.150
Old man, you should stop drinking already.

13:45.820 --> 13:48.860
Just because you became friend with him,

13:48.860 --> 13:54.180
Shiba wouldn't have given you
the Ten Commandments or Rave.

13:57.670 --> 14:02.870
Ok, this friendship drama ends now.
I've finally found you, Shiba.

14:03.130 --> 14:04.700
You're very persistent.

14:04.780 --> 14:06.010
Shut up!

14:06.030 --> 14:08.510
You better give Rave this time, you bastard!

14:08.920 --> 14:11.180
If I refuse, what are you going to do?

14:11.720 --> 14:13.600
You want to get hurt?

14:15.600 --> 14:19.380
Hey, you! You should take care of your elders.

14:20.020 --> 14:21.770
Who the hell are you?

14:21.790 --> 14:23.170
That's what my sister said.

14:23.200 --> 14:24.110
Don't, Haru.

14:24.820 --> 14:25.690
Leave him to me, old man.

14:25.930 --> 14:28.320
There isn't a single guy on
this island who can beat me.

14:33.740 --> 14:34.990
Hmhp, that tickled.

14:36.830 --> 14:39.000
Don't interrupt me, boy!

14:43.290 --> 14:46.630
Damn... This can't be...

14:48.130 --> 14:49.130
Step aside, Haru.

14:49.970 --> 14:52.100
Want to give me the Rave now?

14:52.130 --> 14:53.730
I will never give it to you.

14:54.180 --> 14:56.080
You must have a death wish, huh?

14:57.430 --> 15:02.430
Saying such dumb things... How many
of your friends have died by my hands?

15:02.530 --> 15:04.900
You old hag! Do you think you're strong?

15:05.520 --> 15:06.650
Who the hell is he?

15:07.020 --> 15:10.900
He's a low class guy from the Demon Card,
the organization that has Dark Bring.

15:12.110 --> 15:13.670
Low class, huh?

15:13.700 --> 15:15.400
What is that?

15:15.530 --> 15:16.940
Leave him to me.

15:17.640 --> 15:18.900
Come on, attack me!

15:21.000 --> 15:23.750
Get off this island now.

15:24.920 --> 15:26.940
Rave, give me strength!

15:27.800 --> 15:29.630
What's wrong, old man?!

15:30.380 --> 15:31.300
Rave?!

15:31.800 --> 15:33.790
What are you doing?!

15:34.300 --> 15:37.960
I can't use Rave?! How come?!

15:38.200 --> 15:38.800
Farewell.

15:42.890 --> 15:44.310
Over...

15:44.950 --> 15:45.970
Shiba!

15:49.400 --> 15:52.850
This is indeed a Punk Street weapon!

15:53.330 --> 15:54.800
Shiba, hang in there?

15:56.820 --> 16:01.620
Haru... take this and... run far away.

16:02.830 --> 16:03.990
What is this?

16:04.420 --> 16:06.330
Get out of here! Hurry...

16:07.020 --> 16:08.880
Hey, you can't do that.

16:08.920 --> 16:10.710
Give it to me!

16:11.010 --> 16:12.140
Damn...

16:12.510 --> 16:16.360
Whenever a friend is in
danger, I must help them!

16:16.250 --> 16:16.650
Huh?

16:17.010 --> 16:20.990
To run away by myself is not right!

16:21.340 --> 16:23.100
That's what my sister said!

16:23.100 --> 16:28.610
The friendship drama is still going on. Whatever, just give it to me!

16:29.820 --> 16:33.990
Haru, hurry up... and run away with that!

16:36.820 --> 16:39.910
It... It's no use. He's not listening to me at all.

16:39.910 --> 16:43.210
At this rate, Rave will go to
the hands of the Demon Card.

16:45.120 --> 16:46.960
Haru, I said run!

16:47.630 --> 16:48.630
Wha... quick...

16:50.550 --> 16:52.190
What?!

16:58.220 --> 16:59.220
Wow!

17:00.320 --> 17:02.430
What power.

17:02.430 --> 17:05.960
Get up! The pain you got is nothing compared to Shiba's.

17:06.490 --> 17:08.850
Don't get excited, boy!

17:12.130 --> 17:13.830
Oh no!

17:20.620 --> 17:20.980
Oh...

17:32.500 --> 17:33.840
It exploded...

17:34.130 --> 17:35.070
Haru.

17:36.800 --> 17:38.960
The thing I just gave you...

17:39.200 --> 17:40.960
This is Rave.

17:43.110 --> 17:45.430
This is... Rave?

17:45.430 --> 17:46.320
That's right.

17:46.930 --> 17:48.680
Why did it explode?

17:48.940 --> 17:50.950
That's the power of Rave.

17:51.760 --> 17:56.590
Only one person in the world can use Rave.

17:57.050 --> 17:57.300
Huh?

17:58.030 --> 18:00.910
For these past fifty years, that person was me.

18:01.410 --> 18:07.190
But, just a minute ago, I couldn't
use Rave and that guy defeated me.

18:07.260 --> 18:09.750
Do you understand what that means?

18:11.500 --> 18:14.390
Now, a new Rave Master,

18:14.390 --> 18:17.640
in other words, a new successor has appeared!

18:20.130 --> 18:23.410
If this story is true, and it might be...

18:25.510 --> 18:28.350
Old man, please. Fix this sword.

18:28.640 --> 18:33.990
I told you that I quit being a blacksmith.

18:34.820 --> 18:36.960
Now I'm just a drunkard.

18:37.400 --> 18:43.530
I've even became another Demon
Card dog so I can survive.

18:43.730 --> 18:45.070
That's not true.

18:45.090 --> 18:45.390
Eh?

18:46.890 --> 18:48.650
You are not that type of man.

18:48.790 --> 18:49.740
I can tell that by your eyes.

18:50.210 --> 18:52.620
Otherwise, you wouldn't have
offered to give Rave back to me.

18:56.500 --> 18:57.620
What is it?

18:59.090 --> 19:00.720
What are you saying, boy?

19:01.010 --> 19:03.250
What does a kid like you know about me?

19:03.300 --> 19:04.600
Because your eyes are...

19:04.720 --> 19:06.230
Fifteen years!

19:07.070 --> 19:10.070
I haven't fixed a sword in fifteen years.

19:10.180 --> 19:11.860
Look at this hand!

19:12.040 --> 19:17.210
This hand, shaky from alcohol, do you think
I could fix such a precious sword with it?

19:19.170 --> 19:21.410
If you understand, go home now.

19:25.250 --> 19:26.100
Plue?!

19:28.090 --> 19:29.630
What's wrong, Plue?

19:38.300 --> 19:39.300
Musica!

19:41.220 --> 19:42.630
I wasted too much time...

19:43.300 --> 19:44.220
What happened?!

19:46.220 --> 19:48.650
We don't have time, we must hurry.

19:49.010 --> 19:51.000
So, what happened?!

19:51.040 --> 19:52.990
Elie... got kidnapped.

19:54.240 --> 19:55.420
Who did it?!

19:55.450 --> 19:56.610
A man named Lance.

20:00.230 --> 20:01.640
You can't defeat him.

20:01.640 --> 20:07.100
Even if you are a Rave Master, do you think
you stand a chance against Lance?!

20:08.700 --> 20:10.350
But, I promised her.

20:12.330 --> 20:14.590
As the next Rave Master,

20:14.650 --> 20:19.250
I will defeat the Demon Card for
my family and I'll make it home...

20:19.470 --> 20:21.010
...I promised her that.

20:22.800 --> 20:24.400
Elie is not related to me by blood, but

20:24.600 --> 20:28.040
she is like family to me, since we have been traveling.

20:28.220 --> 20:31.840
Family is a very precious thing...
It's what my sister used to say.

20:36.310 --> 20:39.090
Even a little kid like him is
trying to fulfill his mission by

20:39.090 --> 20:44.220
going into a fight recklessly
in order to protect someone.

20:55.320 --> 20:57.420
Compared to him, I've been...

20:58.710 --> 21:00.810
Haru! Hurry up, time is running out.

21:02.210 --> 21:03.210
I have no choice...

21:04.980 --> 21:06.040
Let's go Plue!

21:06.220 --> 21:07.010
Wait, kid!

21:10.110 --> 21:12.430
Are you going try and fight
against him with a broken sword?

21:13.430 --> 21:14.540
One hour!

21:16.050 --> 21:19.820
One hour from now, this is my fight.

21:19.890 --> 21:21.320
Your fight?

21:23.230 --> 21:29.810
I had forgotten. I've never thought
of fighting even once, until now.

21:30.410 --> 21:34.600
But now I've realized the fight I should be in!

21:35.040 --> 21:35.450
Then...

21:39.630 --> 21:44.140
After fifteen years, once again, I will fix a sword!

21:44.710 --> 21:48.210
...this last sword... in the name of Musica.

21:48.380 --> 21:51.440
I'll fix it with all my strength and my soul!

21:52.220 --> 21:53.500
Old man!

21:55.980 --> 21:57.590
One hour left.

22:03.610 --> 22:08.310
I'm so excited. I want to cut them now!

22:13.620 --> 22:23.950
Under the moon, I became a chrysalis, kissed upon a glass sea of love.

22:23.950 --> 22:33.890
Your rhythm is like a wave, embraced by the words of its song.

22:33.890 --> 22:44.020
Live to feel me, my past disappears on the water's surface.

22:44.520 --> 22:54.630
Everything I believed in, I found with you, so...

22:54.630 --> 23:04.860
You're the wings on my heart, this wish, a distant dream that melts on a deserted island.

23:04.860 --> 23:18.780
All I want is for the bluebird to lead me to you, and drift through the country.

23:19.060 --> 23:26.030
Toward the small sky that weeps.

23:43.500 --> 23:47.410
Hurry up, old man, the beast swordsman Lance has Elie.

23:48.000 --> 23:51.370
It's 5pm now, I'm going take this girl's life!

23:53.050 --> 23:58.310
I'll defeat Lance with the Ten Commandments,
the old man fixed with all his soul.

23:59.100 --> 24:00.190
On the next episode of Rave

24:00.410 --> 24:02.620
Revival of the Ten Commandments

24:02.640 --> 24:04.160
Haru, come quick!
